  "reduction": {
    "crystal": "one direction, no averaging: S_C(q) = S_C(q dhat) on the momenta collinear with the chosen axis.  A Wigner crystal is not isotropic, so a shell mean would mix distinct modes and destroy the Bragg peak.",
