    "order_of_operations": "S(q-vector) -> S(q) -> q^2/(2 S(q)); never <q^2/(2 S(q-vector))>",
    "paper_fig4_caption": "\"The data are rotation averaged in the liquid phase and taken along the x axis in the crystal phase.\""
  },
